WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:01.740
A dim workshop.

2
00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:04.520
Smoke curls from glass phials.

3
00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:07.890
An old man grinds powder
in a stone mortar.

4
00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:11.580
A woman from court ties
on a glass mask and asks:

5
00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:14.610
"Which is the poison to
poison her, prithee?"

6
00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:17.650
Far off, the King's dance is playing.

7
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:21.340
Instead, she sits and
watches: "Grind away,

8
00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:25.330
moisten and mash up thy paste,"
She could send a servant.

9
00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:27.980
So why does she watch every step?

10
00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:32.060
In this mission, you'll meet the speaker
of Robert Browning's dramatic monologue,

11
00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:34.150
and her silent listener.

12
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.220
You'll find out where
her lover is tonight,

13
00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:38.000
and who he is with.

14
00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:41.600
And you'll hear a quick rhythm
that skips like a dance.

15
00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:45.580
Your mission: explain why she
wants to watch it being made.
